Malware sandboxes allow analysts to observe:
•	File behavior 
•	Network connections 
•	Downloaded payloads 
•	System changes 
•	Processes created 
•	Indicators of Compromise (IOCs) 
By uploading a suspicious attachment from a phishing email, analysts can determine:
•	Which URLs the file contacts. 
•	Whether additional malware is downloaded. 
•	What changes are made to the system. 
•	How the malware behaves. 
